          <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/arifu/ontologies/2026/3/riceMMKG#Pest"/>
          <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/arifu/ontologies/2026/3/riceMMKG#Symptom"/>
        </owl:unionOf>
      </owl:Class>
    </rdfs:range>
    <rdfs:comment>Records the raw source-dataset label assigned to an Observation (e.g. a Paddy Doctor image), independent of the detects/detectedBy relation used for confirmed field or literature-backed detections.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment>The range is a union of Disease, HealthStatus, Pest, and Symptom because this property carries ground-truth annotations from the Paddy Doctor dataset, whose label set mixes diseases, pests, symptoms, and a healthy class in a single flat vocabulary. It records what the dataset asserts, not a classification conclusion drawn by this ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>annotated as</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">classified as</rdfs:label>
  </owl:ObjectProperty>
