    <rdfs:label>Sensor Observation</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>An Observation channel: a measurement captured by an environmental sensor (e.g. temperature, humidity, soil pH), relatable to an EnvironmentalFactor via captures. No individuals populated yet -- added to match the conceptual schema ahead of sensor data ingestion, per the deferred-design roadmap in Worklog/RiceMMKG_v0.4-minimal_worklog/deferred_design.md.</rdfs:comment>
